OL,3,GNEWSALancashire prison to gain 240
OL,4,Aextra places
OL,5,
OL,6,FA north Lancashire prison is to gain
OL,7,F240 extra prison places, the government
OL,8,Fhas said.
OL,10,FHMP Lancaster Farms will gain four new
OL,11,Fhouseblocks, boosting its capacity from
OL,12,F584 to 824 places.
OL,14,FThe new cells - part of a plan to
OL,15,Ftackle overcrowding in existing prisons
OL,16,Fin England and Wales - will have modern
OL,17,Fsecurity features such as reinforced
OL,18,Fwindows to tackle threats like drones
OL,19,Fcarrying contraband.
OL,21,FConstruction is due to finish by the
OL,22,Fend of the year.
OL,23,APub: 14-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
